[1;33m[WARN][0m   Review: changes_requested (1 issue(s)) — The implementation correctly addresses all prior review feedback: (1) live_preview block uses preview_token (not management_token) with enable:true, conditional on CONTENTSTACK_PREVIEW_TOKEN; (2) no host field inside live_preview — host is handled separately via Stack.setHost(CONTENTSTACK_PREVIEW_HOST || CONTENTSTACK_API_HOST); (3) ICommonContentstackConfig gains optional live_preview field (IContentstackLivePreviewConfig with enable? and preview_hash?) and setCommonConfig destructures and forwards it via query.addParam('live_preview', live_preview.preview_hash) — not void-discarded; (4) vitest unit tests exist at the correct path src/services/__tests__/contentstack.spec.ts covering all three required scenarios (live_preview present with preview_token when token set, absent when unset, setHost priority) plus additional tests verifying preview_hash forwarding via addParam. The interface file src/interface/contentstack.ts was actually edited as required. However, findSingletonEntry and getSingletonEntry — two of the four public query functions — do not forward live_preview to createContentTypeQuery, silently dropping preview context for those code paths. This is inconsistent with getEntry and getSingleEntry which correctly forward it, and means content fetched via these two functions will not show draft values for linked/tabular references.

